    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Y'all ready to go hyper berzerk?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355110/extras/127e2016969795a31be8cda3daf49004.poster.avif?t=1734378422\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355110/extras/127e2016969795a31be8cda3daf49004.webm?t=1734378422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355110/extras/127e2016969795a31be8cda3daf49004.mp4?t=1734378422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultra Hyper Auto-Shooter Cowboy Mayhem Action Bullet Hell</strong> or <i>UHASCMABH</i> for short :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the reins as a bullet bandit with their mind and soul set on freeing the souls of several long dead creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355110/extras/f3d72a4501e4dbc8b48acccb4b6c4a60.poster.avif?t=1734378422\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355110/extras/f3d72a4501e4dbc8b48acccb4b6c4a60.webm?t=1734378422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355110/extras/f3d72a4501e4dbc8b48acccb4b6c4a60.mp4?t=1734378422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 missions (30+ levels total)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BULLET HELL. CHAOS. RATTLE SNAKES. BOSSES</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay each chapter to earn S rank and complete the bonus challenge achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra SHORT! Ultra sweet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355110/extras/d146c99bf48aa9f24f5342626a7b364c.poster.avif?t=1734378422\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355110/extras/d146c99bf48aa9f24f5342626a7b364c.webm?t=1734378422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355110/extras/d146c99bf48aa9f24f5342626a7b364c.mp4?t=1734378422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAMEPAD recommended partner!\ud83e\udd20</p>",
